{
  "uid": "llmsx-business",
  "title": "Website status and business signals",
  "version": 2,
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "editable": false,
  "tags": [
    "operations",
    "business"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "project",
        "label": "Domain",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "llmsx.org : llmsx,llms-explorer.com : llms-explorer,oraclebot.io : oraclebot,morelube.com : morelube,skaas.io : skaas,netdnsmonitor.com : netdnsmonitor",
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Website status and business signals",
      "description": "",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "Unknown / no data",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "[Fleet infrastructure](/d/llmsx-fleet). Select one or more domains. The alias has separate traffic and email, and shares the primary site's product. Missing data displays as unknown. Stripe currency values use provider minor units. Alerts are visible here when provider data is available."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
